findings.suggestion:
用统一的带兜底解析函数同时解决上限与非法输入：
MAX_PAGE_SIZE = 100
def _to_int(raw, default, lo, hi):
    try:
        v = int(raw)
    except (TypeError, ValueError):
        return default
    return min(max(v, lo), hi)
page = _to_int(request.get("page", 1), 1, 1, 10 ** 6)
page_size = _to_int(request.get("page_size", 20), 20, 1, MAX_PAGE_SIZE)
